{"sections":[{"slug":"偏屈t-结构","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"偏屈t-结构"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">偏屈</span> t-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"偏屈 t-结构"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">偏屈</span> t-<span lang=\"zh\">结构是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可构造层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可构造</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">复形范畴</span> $D_c^b(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/t-结构","text":"t-<span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>"}},{"Plain":",</p>\n<p>$$\r\n{^p D_c ^{\\leq 0}} (X) = \\{F \\in D_c^b(X) \\mid \\forall j \\in\\mathbb{Z}, \\dim \\operatorname{supp} H^j(F)\\leq j\\},\r\n$$</p>\n<p>$$\r\n{^p D_c ^{\\geq 0}} (X) = \\{F \\in D_c^b(X) \\mid \\forall j \\in\\mathbb{Z},\\dim \\operatorname{supp} H^j(\\mathbb D F)\\leq - j\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}